			description: [
				"&8[ ADDENDUM — THE ENGINEERS' ANSWER ]&r"
				""
				"&7Knowing how it ended has not stopped me. I understand them better now. You do not build the next rocket because you think it will save you.&r"
				""
				"&8Objective: build what they would have built next. A Tier 4 rocket.&r"
