			description: [
				"&8[ ADDENDUM — THE OTHER ANSWER ]&r"
				""
				"&7They left, and it did not matter. So I am going to try the one thing the records never mention anyone trying.&r"
				""
				"&8Objective: stay. Grow a colony to 75 citizens and let it be noticed.&r"
